                                                "example_id": "f2209db2-dffd-43d0-ae49-91d17ab2b97d",
                                                "sense_id": "6d68c950-fd8d-368f-975f-e19787074367",
                                                "text": "其中往来种作，男女衣著，悉如外人。",
